# kept local only, not pushed to GitHub.
/docs/

# AI coding agent instruction files — local dev aid only, not for the pushed
# repo. AGENTS.md is regenerated automatically by `next dev`, so removing it
# from git has no effect on local development.
/AGENTS.md
/CLAUDE.md

